# Route: guide 26 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1291 of 1301 eligible quests, 161.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 49 to
# 50, 41 quests, 1.4 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Undercity, Orgrimmar, Azshara): Undercity -> near Undercity ->
# Undercity -> near Undercity -> Undercity -> near Undercity -> near Orgrimmar
# -> Orgrimmar -> near Orgrimmar -> Valormok -> Ruins of Eldarath -> Valormok
# -> Timbermaw Hold -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Whispering Horror Residue (95328;
# Whispering Horror 11-13); Necklace Recovery (2283; Shadowforge Surveyor
# 35-36, Shadowforge Ruffian 36-37, Shadowforge Digger 35-36, Stonevault
# Rockchewer 36-37, Stonevault Oracle 37-38, Stonevault Cave Hunter 36-37).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): The Book of Ur (1013), The Book of Ur (1013), Going,
# Going, Guano! (1109), Going, Going, Guano! (1109), Bring the End (3341), The
# Power to Destroy... (5725), Light's Justice (92421), Light's Justice
# (92421), The New Plague (95216), Source of Power (96988), Necklace Recovery,
# Take 2 (2284), Rig Wars (2841), Rig Wars (2841), The Royal Rescue (4003),
# For The Horde! (4974), Returning the Lost Satchel (5724), Hidden Enemies
# (5728), Hidden Enemies (5728), Slaying the Beast (5761), Slaying the Beast
# (5761), Changing Tastes (95697), Changing Tastes (95697).

